 "text": "Skip to Main Content\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205\n\nAbout Us\nContact\nFAQ's\nYour Trip\nTravel Info\nBlog\nThe Safari of a Lifetime\nEnquire Now\nRead Reviews\nMazingira Safari Welcomes you to Tanzania\n\nMazingira Safari is a top-notch Tanzanian safari tour operator that offers authentic and custom-built safari experiences led by native guides. Our services include wildlife safaris, cultural tours, adventure tours, beach holidays, honeymoon packages, and photography safaris, ensuring an immersive and genuine journey through Tanzania's landscapes and cultures. Let's start planning your dream trip today!\n\nTailor Made Packages\nSerengeti Escape\nA Romantic Adventure\n\nEmbark on a breathtaking five-day romantic safari with the \"Serengeti Escape: A Romantic Adventure.\" Designed for couples, this trip combines luxury, wildlife, and cultural experiences in Tanzania’s stunning landscapes.\n\n5 DAYS FROM $3950pp\n\nLuxury Savannah to Shore 9 Day Adventure\n\nFrom Savannah to Shore : A 9-Day Tanzanian safari and Zanzibar Retreat. Enjoy a wonderful safari adventure, visiting the breathtaking Serengeti, Ngorongoro Crater and Tarangire National Park. Then sit back and unwind on the luxury beaches of Zanzibar, with golden sands and crystal blue waters.\n\n9 DAYS FROM $5495pp\n\nSerengeti Under The Stars\n\nThis itinerary provides an immersive connection with nature. Lower budget camping offers a sustainable and authentic way to experience the wilderness, making safaris more accessible while fostering a deeper appreciation for wildlife conservation.\n\n7 DAYS FROM $2199pp\n\nREAD MORE\nREAD MORE\nREAD MORE\nDiscover Tanzania's Hidden Gems\n\nUnforgettable Experiences Guaranteed\n\nAt Mazingira Safari, we are passionate about exploring Tanzania's landscapes and cultures. We'll help you create an unforgettable experience that fits your budget and interests. Our team will take care of accommodation, transportation, travel insurance, and all the extras, so you can focus on having fun. Are you ready to discover Tanzania's hidden gems?\n\nLearn More\nJoin our mailing list for special offers !\nEmail\nSubscribe\nSafari Gallery\nVictor H\n\nIncredible Tanzania trip thanks to Mazingira, the team was very flexible and empathetic regarding alternate starting times. options for lodges and enlarging our stay in Tanzania. I would definitely recommend Mazingira for and unforgettable Tanzania experience in Tanzania !!\n\nPhoenix S\n\nLIFE CHANGING\n\nOur tour guides were amazing and knew so much about the land and the animals. They were able to find any animal we wanted to see and more ! The safari it's self was an experience of a life time.\n\nCarly A\n\nDefinitely the king of African safari's\n\n​\n\nOur safari guides were top notch! We enjoyed their knowledge of the land and the animals and of course, some of their humor. We felt safe and really had the best time. Our catered lunches were delicious. We fell in love with this land and culture. a giant thank you to Jacob, his family and his employees.\n\nWidget Didn’t Load\nCheck your internet and refresh this page.\nIf that doesn’t work, contact us.\nRefresh this page\nContact us\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\nuk.sales@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205 / +255767278204\n\nAccessibility Statement \n\nMazingira Eco Friendly Safari Adventure\n\nArusha \n\nP.O Box 12544\n\nStay informed, join our newsletter\n\nEnter your email here \nSubscribe\n\nMazingira Safari © 2023 | ",
